ginal/'+s.id} target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Reveal original evidence · owner only</a>}</article>)}<details className=\"panel\"><summary>Audit method and reconciliation scope</summary><p>Original statements are preserved byte-for-byte. Redacted derivatives alter only privacy-sensitive presentation. Signed charge cents, wording, source months and pages drive the calculations. All monthly new-service totals reconcile to itemized service charges, and each prior balance plus signed payments/credits plus new services reconciles to total due. Bill page numbers match PDF page indices; trailing blank pages remain. Source categories are navigation aids, not changes to printed wording. No authorization, device identity or wrongdoing is inferred.</p></details></>}
 <footer><span>GMRI / EVIDENCE ACCOUNTABILITY</span><small>Prepared from supplied records · October 5, 2026 · source facts, calculations and account-holder reports remain distinct.</small><span><LockKeyhole size={12}/>Restricted access · redacted by default</span></footer></main>
 <Sheet open={"'!!evidence} onOpenChange={open=>{if(!open)setEvidence(null)}}><SheetContent className="evidence-drawer" side="right"><SheetTitle className="drawer-title"><Archive size={20}/>{evidence?.title||'"'Evidence case file'}</SheetTitle><SheetDescription className=\"drawer-description\">Source evidence stays tied to its originating bill and page. This drawer displays redacted derivatives.</SheetDescription>{evidence&&drawerSource&&drawerBill&&<><div className=\"drawer-meta\"><img src=\"/gmri-logo.jpeg\" alt=\"GMRI receipt stamp\"/><dl><dt>Source</dt><dd>AT&T statement</dd><dt>Issue date</dt><dd>{drawerBill.date}</dd><dt>Bill name</dt><dd>{drawerBill.file}</dd><dt>Invoice</dt><dd>{invoice(drawerBill)}</dd><dt>Page</dt><dd>{drawerSource.page}</dd></dl><div><State value={evidence.state}/><span className=\"receipt-text\">RECEIPT</span></div></div>{evidence.note&&<div className=\"drawer-note\">{evidence.note}</div>}<div className=\"drawer-controls\"><label>Source page<select value={sourceIndex} onChange={e=>setSourceIndex(+e.target.value)}>{evidence.refs.map((r,i)=><option key={r.bill+'-'+r.page} value={i}>{bill(r.bill).date} · p. {r.page}</option>)}</select></label><label>Page within this bill<select value={drawerSource.page} onChange={e=>{const page=+e.target.value;setEvidence({...evidence,refs:evidence.refs.map((r,i)=>i===sourceIndex?{...r,page,exact:undefined}:r)})}}>{drawerBill.pages.map((_:any,i:number)=><option value={i+1} key={i}>Page {i+1}</option>)}</select></label></div><div className=\"drawer-view-toggle\">{(['both','page','text'] as const).map(t=><button className={drawerTab===t?'selected':''} key={t} onClick={()=>setDrawerTab(t)}>{t==='both'?'Page + text':t==='page'?'Source page':'Extracted text'}</button>)}<a href={'/bills/'+drawerBill.id+'.pdf#page='+drawerSource.page} target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Redacted PDF</a>{isOwner&&"'!fieldMode&&<a className="original-link" href={'"'/api/original/'+drawerBill.id+'#page='+drawerSource.page} target=\"